REX Player - merged build
=========================

This repository is a personal fork of REX Player. It combines code from two
independent open-source Android video players. All credit for the original work
belongs to their authors and contributors.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. REX Player  (base application - all application UI, browser, player shell,
   Jellyfin, network streaming, Shorts mode, yt-dlp companion support)

   Upstream:  https://github.com/mpvRex/REX-Player
   Copyright (c) the REX Player contributors
   License:   Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE-2.0)
   Builds on: mpvEx          https://github.com/marlboro-advance/mpvEx
                              Apache License 2.0
              mpv-android    https://github.com/mpv-android/mpv-android
                              MIT License

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. mpvRx  (donor application - ported subsystems: subtitle pipeline and online
   subtitle search, appearance/theming system, navigation bar, chapter and
   skip-segment timestamps, AI integration)

   Upstream:  https://github.com/Riteshp2001/mpvRx
   Copyright (c) the mpvRx contributors
   License:   GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later
              (see LICENSE)
   Builds on: mpv-android    https://github.com/mpv-android/mpv-android
                              MIT License

   Every file ported from mpvRx keeps its original
   "SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later" header and its copyright
   notice. Files that were adapted carry a note naming the upstream path they
   came from.

